Package: fosos-theme
Version: 0.4.0
Section: x11
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: greybird-gtk-theme, elementary-xfce-icon-theme, fonts-inter, fonts-liberation, dmz-cursor-theme, plymouth, lxpolkit
Maintainer: FosOS <dev@fosos.local>
Description: FosOS desktop branding and defaults
 Wallpaper, boot splash, and session defaults. The FosOS LightDM greeter
 ships in fosos-desktop; Greybird and elementary-xfce remain available as
 a fallback. FosOS Desktop uses its own GTK and icon themes. lxpolkit
 provides password prompts.
